<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">Gansu QLS was established in August&nbsp;2006
under the laws of the PRC with initial capital of approximately $0.27 million. After several registered capital increases and capital
contributions, the registered and paid capital of Gansu QLS was approximately $12 million as of September&nbsp;30, 2024 and 2023. Over
the&nbsp;years, Gansu QLS has established seven subsidiaries:</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0">&nbsp;</P>

