<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0"><B>NOTE&nbsp;8&nbsp;&ndash; LONG-TERM INVESTMENT</B></P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">In July&nbsp;2024, Qilian International acquired
25% ownership interest of Caihou Capital (Shenzhen) Group Co., Ltd (&ldquo;Caihou&rdquo;) with a total investment amount of RMB25,000,000,
which have been paid in the amount of RMB10,000,000 ($1,402,584 equivalent) in 2024.The investment was accounted for using equity method.
The remaining RMB 15 million was fully paid on October&nbsp;28, 2024.</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">On June&nbsp;26, 2025, the Company acquired YX
Management Company Limited, which holds a 44.6715% equity interest in Fanhua Insurance Surveyors&nbsp;&amp; Loss Adjusters Co.,&nbsp;Ltd.
(approximately RMB 61,200,000) through its subsidiary, GD Yunyue.</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0"></P>

